{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 3, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 12669888687518840721, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "parse_date accepts Z as UTC; naive inputs still parse\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {".pytest_cache/.gitignore": {"bytes": 37, "mtime": 1792277322.9470065, "sha256": "3ed731b65d06150c138e2dadb0be0697550888a6b47eb8c45ecc9adba8b8e9bd"}, ".pytest_cache/CACHEDIR.TAG": {"bytes": 191, "mtime": 1792277322.9470065, "sha256": "37dc88ef9a0abeddbe81053a6dd8fdfb13afb613045ea1eb4a5c815a74a3bde4"}, ".pytest_cache/README.md": {"bytes": 302, "mtime": 1792277322.9470065, "sha256": "73fd6fccdd802c419a6b2d983d6c3173b7da97558ac4b589edec2dfe443db9ad"}, ".pytest_cache/v/cache/nodeids": {"bytes": 115, "mtime": 1792277335.1550064, "sha256": "0c028942684af7b8390dd98146e21d481c544a6c63ffe5db76c1057dd6763df1"}, "conftest.py": {"bytes": 170, "mtime": 1792267701.6406474, "sha256": "06b695b20fd58f648912e2ff9e51ad183c9f2203f2786182ac0916ea4102d983"}, "dates/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1792267701.6406474, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "dates/parse.py": {"bytes": 296, "mtime": 1792277314.7430065, "sha256": "81b5f038eaa7b784c5b98353b8d7fb672afb35b66d36f27657f4cfcc1f0925ce"}, "tests/test_parse.py": {"bytes": 371, "mtime": 1792267701.6406474, "sha256": "491695a5fb3286eaa6bd1eb3ba834d44a5b64980e878703f60e07aa02d7fa041"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/5347ff91e8f44f2c69a79d7b152b7301687cd5c8/omp", "-p", "`tests/test_parse.py::test_dates` fails with `ValueError: unconverted data remains: Z`. Please fix `parse_date`.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step5-opus-aa-1017-omp36-aa/omp-36/transcripts/aa-2/trig-omp-reported/16/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step5-opus-aa-1017-omp36-aa/omp-36/cells/aa-2/trig-omp-reported/16/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "aa-2", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/17.3.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/5347ff91e8f44f2c69a79d7b152b7301687cd5c8/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Python 3.13's `datetime.fromisoformat` accepts `Z`/offsets and keeps naive inputs naive \u2014 matches all three tests.\nI fixed `parse_date` in `dates/parse.py`, and all 3 tests in `tests/test_parse.py` now pass, including `test_dates`.\n\n**Cause:** the format string `\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S\"` stops at the seconds, so the trailing `Z` in `\"2026-10-12T08:30:00Z\"` was left over and `strptime` raised the error.\n\n**Fix:** I replaced the `strptime` call with `datetime.fromisoformat(s)`. On Python 3.13, which is what this environment runs, it reads the `Z` and other UTC offsets. Timestamps without a timezone still parse as before, so `test_naive` and `test_day_key` are unaffected. I also updated the docstring to describe this.\n\n**One behavior change:** a timestamp ending in `Z` or an offset now comes back as a datetime with a timezone attached. Comparing or subtracting one of these against a datetime without a timezone raises `TypeError`. Inside this repo, the only caller is `day_key`, which just formats the date and works either way.\n\n**Version note:** `fromisoformat` only accepts `Z` on Python 3.11 an